# Coobi Logistics - environment template.
#
# Usage: copy this file to `.env` and fill in your own values.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# `.env` is ignored by Git (.gitignore) and must never be committed.
#
# No variable is defined here yet. Issue MVP-0.3 "Define project configuration"
# owns the complete environment contract (Kafka, PostgreSQL and the simulator
# thresholds) and will document every variable together with its safe
# development default in this file.
#
# Until then this file stays intentionally empty of variables and values, so
# that no credential or environment-specific configuration can enter the
# repository.
